-- Tests for Dieu 62-63. Dieu 63(3)(b) and (c) are replaced by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(2) from 1 January
-- 2026: "bao hiem cho rui ro tu vong" (V1) becomes "bao hiem tu ky" (V2, V3). Each scenario is run in V1 and
-- in V2; V3 is the same text as V2 for this article.

§ `Tests: Dieu 62-63`

§§ `Dieu 62`

-- src:1135 | Điều 62. Các hình thức tổ chức hoạt động của doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm,
-- src:1136 | doanh nghiệp tái bảo hiểm
-- src:1137 | 1. Công ty cổ phần.
-- src:1138 | 2. Công ty trách nhiệm hữu hạn.
#ASSERT `Dieu 62: the form is one an insurer or reinsurer may take` `a joint stock company`
#ASSERT `Dieu 62: the form is one an insurer or reinsurer may take` `a limited liability company`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 62: the form is one an insurer or reinsurer may take` `another form of organisation`

§§ `Dieu 63(1)-(2)`

-- src:1141 | 1. Nội dung hoạt động của doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp
-- src:1142 | bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ nước ngoài bao gồm:
-- src:1143 | a) Kinh doanh bảo hiểm, kinh doanh tái bảo hiểm, nhượng tái bảo hiểm;
-- src:1144 | b) Quản lý các quỹ và đầu tư vốn từ hoạt động kinh doanh bảo hiểm;
-- src:1145 | CÔNG BÁO/Số 575 + 576/Ngày 17-7-2022 39
-- src:1147 | c) Cung cấp dịch vụ phụ trợ bảo hiểm;
-- src:1148 | d) Hoạt động khác liên quan trực tiếp đến hoạt động kinh doanh bảo hiểm.
-- src:1149 | 2. Nội dung hoạt động của doanh nghiệp tái bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp
-- src:1150 | tái bảo hiểm nước ngoài bao gồm:
-- src:1151 | a) Kinh doanh tái bảo hiểm; nhượng tái bảo hiểm;
-- src:1152 | b) Quản lý các quỹ và đầu tư vốn từ hoạt động kinh doanh tái bảo hiểm;
-- src:1153 | c) Hoạt động khác liên quan trực tiếp đến hoạt động kinh doanh tái bảo hiểm.
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a life insurer` `insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a non-life insurer` `supplying ancillary insurance services`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer` `managing funds and investing capital from insurance business`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a life insurer` `reinsurance business and ceding`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a reinsurer` `reinsurance business and ceding`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a branch of a foreign reinsurer` `another activity directly related to reinsurance business`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a reinsurer` `supplying ancillary insurance services`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a microinsurance mutual organisation` `reinsurance business and ceding`

§§ `Dieu 63(3)`

-- src:1154 | 3. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ
-- src:1155 | nước ngoài chỉ được phép kinh doanh một loại hình bảo hiểm quy định tại khoản 1
-- src:1156 | Điều 7 của Luật này, trừ các trường hợp sau đây:
-- src:1157 | a) Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm nhân thọ kinh doanh bảo hiểm sức khỏe;
-- src:1158 | b) Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi nhân thọ, chi nhánh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phi
-- src:1159 | nhân thọ nước ngoài kinh doanh các sản phẩm thuộc loại hình bảo hiểm sức khỏe
-- src:1160 | có thời hạn từ 01 năm trở xuống và các sản phẩm bảo hiểm cho rủi ro tử vong có
-- src:1161 | thời hạn từ 01 năm trở xuống;
-- src:1162 | c) Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm sức khỏe kinh doanh các sản phẩm bảo hiểm cho
-- src:1163 | rủi ro tử vong có thời hạn từ 01 năm trở xuống.
@ref Dieu 63 (src:1154-1163)
`a ten-year life product` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 120
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a ten-year health product` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `health insurance`
    `term in months` IS 120
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a one-year health product` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `health insurance`
    `term in months` IS 12
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a thirteen-month health product` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `health insurance`
    `term in months` IS 13
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a one-year death-cover product (V1 words)` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 12
    `covers the risk of death` IS TRUE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a thirteen-month death-cover product (V1 words)` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 13
    `covers the risk of death` IS TRUE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a one-year term-life product (V2 words)` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 12
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS TRUE
`a motor product` MEANS `A product offered` WITH
    `type of insurance` IS `non-life insurance`
    `term in months` IS 12
    `covers the risk of death` IS FALSE
    `is a term-life product` IS FALSE
`a life insurer with a health product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a ten-year life product`, `a ten-year health product`
`a life insurer with a motor product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a ten-year life product`, `a motor product`
`a non-life insurer with a ten-year health product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a ten-year health product`
`a non-life insurer with a one-year health product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year health product`
`a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month health product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a thirteen-month health product`
`a foreign branch with a one-year health product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year health product`
`a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year death-cover product (V1 words)`
`a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month death-cover product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a thirteen-month death-cover product (V1 words)`
`a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year term-life product (V2 words)`
`a health insurer with a one-year death-cover product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a health insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a ten-year health product`, `a one-year death-cover product (V1 words)`
`a health insurer with a one-year term-life product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a health insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a ten-year health product`, `a one-year term-life product (V2 words)`
`a health insurer with a one-year health-only product and a motor product` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a health insurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a ten-year health product`, `a motor product`
`a reinsurer's business` MEANS `The business of an insurer` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a reinsurer`
    `products offered` IS LIST `a motor product`

-- (a): a life insurer may carry on health insurance, whatever the term: the same in every vintage.
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a health product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a motor product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a motor product`)
-- (b), the health limb: a term of one year or less, the same words in V1 and V2.
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a ten-year health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year health product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a foreign branch with a one-year health product`)
-- (b), the death limb: V1 says "bao hiem cho rui ro tu vong" and V2 says "bao hiem tu ky" (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(2)).
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:32 | 2. Sửa đổi, bổ sung điểm b và điểm c khoản 3 Điều 63 như sau:
