-- src:law139-2025-qh15:34 | phi nhân thọ nước ngoài kinh doanh các sản phẩm thuộc loại hình bảo hiểm sức
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:35 | khỏe có thời hạn từ 01 năm trở xuống và các sản phẩm bảo hiểm tử kỳ có thời hạn
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:36 | từ 01 năm trở xuống;
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:38 | c) Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm sức khỏe kinh doanh các sản phẩm bảo hiểm tử
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:39 | kỳ có thời hạn từ 01 năm trở xuống.”.
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month death-cover product`)
-- (c): a health insurer, the same change.
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year health-only product and a motor product`)
-- Before the Law took effect the death limb answers with a refusal, not with V1's answer.
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2022 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
-- A reinsurer is not governed by Dieu 63(3).
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a reinsurer's business`)
